{"id":"sxd-event-2019-2020-discovery-k3-k8","record_type":"event","name":"新一轮祭祀区考古发现K3—K8","event_type":"考古发现","date_start":"2019-11-26","date_end":"2020-04-02","date_precision":"day_range","site_id":"sanxingdui-site","context_ids":["sanxingdui-k3","sanxingdui-k4","sanxingdui-k5","sanxingdui-k6","sanxingdui-k7","sanxingdui-k8"],"description":"公开简报可核实K3于2019年11月26日发现、K4于2020年1月18日首次识别，K8于2020年3月24日发现异常遗迹并于4月2日确认。K5、K6、K7逐坑发现日期在当前资料中未确认；本事件的日期范围只表示已核实的发现节点。","report_ids":["sxd-report-k3-k8-overview-2022","sxd-report-k3-2024","sxd-report-k4-2024","sxd-report-k8-2024"],"sources":[{"source_id":"sckg-k3-report-2024","url":"https://www.sckg.com/uploads/soft/20240924/2-240924145943M8.pdf","title":"四川广汉市三星堆遗址祭祀区三号坑发掘简报","publisher":"四川省文物考古研究院；《四川文物》","published_at":"2024","accessed_at":"2026-10-18","locator":"三号坑发现与发掘经过","supports":["date_start","context_ids"],"source_type":"excavation_report"},{"source_id":"sckg-k4-report-2024","url":"https://www.sckg.com/uploads/soft/20240514/2-240514103U5564.pdf","title":"四川广汉市三星堆遗址祭祀区四号坑发掘简报","publisher":"四川省文物考古研究院；《四川文物》","published_at":"2024","accessed_at":"2026-10-18","locator":"四号坑发现与发掘经过","supports":["date_start","context_ids"],"source_type":"excavation_report"},{"source_id":"sckg-k8-report-2024","url":"https://www.sckg.com/uploads/soft/20240924/2-240924150035413.pdf","title":"四川广汉市三星堆遗址祭祀区八号坑发掘简报","publisher":"四川省文物考古研究院；《四川文物》","published_at":"2024","accessed_at":"2026-10-18","locator":"八号坑发现与发掘经过","supports":["date_end","context_ids"],"source_type":"excavation_report"}],"record_status":"needs_review","last_verified_at":null}
